            number: "5",
            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">5</span><span class=\"qtext\">Ruby has 3 times as many two-rupee coins as she has five rupee-coins. If she has a total ₹88, how many coins does she have of each type?</span>",
            body: "<span class=\"ln\">No. of ₹5 coins = x</span><span class=\"ln\">No. of ₹2 coins = 3x</span><span class=\"ln\">Amount contributed by ₹5 coins = 5x</span><span class=\"ln\">Amount contributed by ₹2 coins = 2(3x) = 6x</span><span class=\"ln\">∴ 5x + 6x = 88</span><span class=\"ln\">⇒ 11x = 88</span><span class=\"ln\">⇒ <span class=\"box\">x = 8</span></span><span class=\"ln\">∴ ₹5 coins = <span class=\"box\">8</span> and ₹2 coins = <span class=\"box\">24</span>.</span>",
            plainText: "5. Ruby has 3 times as many two-rupee coins as she has five rupee-coins. If she has a total ₹88, how many coins does she have of each type? No. of ₹5 coins = xNo. of ₹2 coins = 3xAmount contributed by ₹5 coins = 5xAmount contributed by ₹2 coins = 2(3x) = 6x∴ 5x + 6x = 88⇒ 11x = 88⇒ x = 8∴ ₹5 coins = 8 and ₹2 coins = 24.",
