            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">No. of ingots received by the merchant for every 2 bags = 15</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">No. of ingots received by the merchant for every bag = <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">15</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">No. of ingots received by the merchant for 12 bags = <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">15 × <span class=\"canc\">12</span><sup class=\"super\">6</sup></span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"canc\">2</span></span></span></span>\n<span class=\"ln indent\">= 90</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Therefore, the merchant will leave with <span class=\"box\">90</span> ingots.</span>\n",
            plainText: "1. A merchant in Lothal exchanges bags of spices for copper ingots — 15 ingots for every 2 bags. If he brings 12 bags, how many ingots does he leave with? No. of ingots received by the merchant for every 2 bags = 15 No. of ingots received by the merchant for every bag = 152 No. of ingots received by the merchant for 12 bags = 15 × 1262 = 90 Therefore, the merchant will leave with 90 ingots.",
