            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">Except thumb, there are 4 fingers in each hand. Each finger is having 3 joints each. Therefore, no. of counts on one hand = 4 × 3</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">= <span class=\"box\">12</span> Ans.</span>\n<span class=\"part-divider\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Base 12 is preferred over base 10 because 12 is divisible by 2, 3, 4, &amp; 6. Making it easier for trade, sharing and measurement.</span>\n",
