            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">2</span><span class=\"qtext\">A spice trader takes a loan of ₹850, makes a profit of ₹1,200 the next day, then a loss of ₹450 the following week. Write this as an equation using integers and find his final financial standing.</span>",
            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">Loan (debt) taken by the trader = ₹850</span>\n<span class=\"ln indent\">∵ debt ∴ negative</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Profit made by him the next day = ₹1,200</span>\n<span class=\"ln indent\">∵ fortune ∴ positive</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Loss incurred in the following week = ₹450</span>\n<span class=\"ln indent\">∵ debt ∴ negative</span>\n<span class=\"ln tiny-gap\">Writing the sequence as an equation, we get</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">= ₹(−850 + 1200 − 450)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">= ₹(1200 − 1300)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">= <span class=\"box\">₹ −100</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln imp-step\">His final financial standing = <span class=\"box\">₹ −100</span> Ans.</span>\n",
