            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">1</span><span class=\"qtext\"><span class=\"ln\">Using the identity (a+b)²=a²+2ab+b², expand the following:</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(i)</b> (7x+4y)²</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(ii)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">7</span><span class=\"d\">5</span></span>x+<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span>y)²</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(iii)</b> (2.5p+1.5q)²</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(iv)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span>s+8t)²</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(v)</b> (x+<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">2y</span></span>)²</span><span class=\"ln\"><b>(vi)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">x</span></span>+<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">y</span></span>)²</span></span>",
            body: "<span class=\"ln\">(7x + 4y)²</span><span class=\"ln\">= (7x)² + (4y)² + 2×7x×4y  [∵ (a+b)²=a²+b²+2ab]</span><span class=\"ln\">= <span class=\"box\">49x² + 16y² + 56xy</span> Ans.</span><div class=\"part-divider\"></div><span class=\"ln\"><b>ii)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">7</span><span class=\"d\">5</span></span> x + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span> y)²</span><span class=\"ln\">= (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">7</span><span class=\"d\">5x</span></span>)² + (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2y</span></span>)² + 2×(<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">7</span><span class=\"d\">5x</span></span>)(<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2y</span></span>)</span><span class=\"ln\">= <span class=\"box\"><span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">49</span><span class=\"d\">25</span></span> x² + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">9</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> y² + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">21</span><span class=\"d\">5</span></span> xy</span> Ans.</span><div class=\"part-divider\"></div><span class=\"ln\"><b>iii)</b> (2.5p + 1.5q)²</span><span class=\"ln\">= (2.5p)² + (1.5q)² + 2×2.5p×1.5q</span><span class=\"ln\">= <span class=\"box\">6.25p² + 2.25q² + 7.5pq</span> Ans.</span><div class=\"part-divider\"></div><span class=\"ln\"><b>iv)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> s + 8t)² = <span class=\"box\"><span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">9</span><span class=\"d\">16</span></span> s² + 12st + 64t²</span> Ans.</span><div class=\"part-divider\"></div><span class=\"ln\"><b>v)</b> (x + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">2y</span></span>)² = <span class=\"box\">x² + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"d\">y</span></span> + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">4y²</span></span></span> Ans.</span><div class=\"part-divider\"></div><span class=\"ln\"><b>vi)</b> (<span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">x</span></span> + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">y</span></span>)² = <span class=\"box\"><span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">x²</span></span> + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><span class=\"d\">xy</span></span> + <span class=\"f\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">y²</span></span></span> Ans.</span>",
            plainText: "1. Using the identity (a+b)²=a²+2ab+b², expand the following:(i) (7x+4y)²(ii) (75x+32y)²(iii) (2.5p+1.5q)²(iv) (34s+8t)²(v) (x+12y)²(vi) (1x+1y)² (7x + 4y)²= (7x)² + (4y)² + 2×7x×4y [∵ (a+b)²=a²+b²+2ab]= 49x² + 16y² + 56xy Ans. ii) (75 x + 32 y)²= (75x)² + (32y)² + 2×(75x)(32y)= 4925 x² + 94 y² + 215 xy Ans. iii) (2.5p + 1.5q)²= (2.5p)² + (1.5q)² + 2×2.5p×1.5q= 6.25p² + 2.25q² + 7.5pq Ans. iv) (34 s + 8t)² = 916 s² + 12st + 64t² Ans. v) (x + 12y)² = x² + xy + 14y² Ans. vi) (1x + 1y)² = 1x² + 2xy + 1y² Ans.",
