            body: "<span class=\"ln\">For chord of length 6 cm, half chord = 3 cm.</span><span class=\"ln\">Distance of the 6 cm chord from the centre = √(5² − 3²) = 4 cm.</span><span class=\"ln\">For chord of length 8 cm, half chord = 4 cm.</span><span class=\"ln\">Distance of the 8 cm chord from the centre = √(5² − 4²) = 3 cm.</span><span class=\"ln\">The chords are on opposite sides of the centre.</span><span class=\"ln\">Distance between their midpoints = 4 + 3 = <span class=\"box\">7 cm</span> Ans.</span>",
