            body: "<span class=\"ln\">AB is a diameter.</span><span class=\"ln\">Therefore, the arc AB is a semicircle and the angle subtended by it at C is half of 180°.</span><span class=\"ln\">∠ACB = <span class=\"box\">90°</span> Ans.</span>",
