            body: "<span class=\"ln\">∠P + ∠R = 180°.</span><span class=\"ln\">(2x + 10) + (3x − 20) = 180</span><span class=\"ln\">⇒ 5x − 10 = 180</span><span class=\"ln\">⇒ <span class=\"box\">x = 38</span>.</span><span class=\"ln\">∠P = 2(38)+10 = <span class=\"box\">86°</span>.</span><span class=\"ln\">∠R = 3(38)−20 = <span class=\"box\">94°</span>.</span>",
