            id: "q1",
            number: "1",
            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">1</span><span class=\"qtext\">Find the 31st term of an AP whose 11th term is 38 and 16th term is 73.</span>",
            body: "<span class=\"ln\">t₁₁=38 ⇒ a+10d=38 ...(1)</span><span class=\"ln\">t₁₆=73 ⇒ a+15d=73 ...(2)</span><span class=\"ln\">Subtracting: 5d=35 ⇒ d=7.</span><span class=\"ln\">a+70=38 ⇒ a=−32.</span><span class=\"ln\">t₃₁=−32+30×7=<span class=\"box\">178</span>.</span>",
            plainText: "1. Find the 31st term of an AP whose 11th term is 38 and 16th term is 73. t₁₁=38 ⇒ a+10d=38 ...(1)t₁₆=73 ⇒ a+15d=73 ...(2)Subtracting: 5d=35 ⇒ d=7.a+70=38 ⇒ a=−32.t₃₁=−32+30×7=178.",
