            number: "2",
            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">2</span><span class=\"qtext\">Determine the AP whose third term is 16 and whose 7th term exceeds the 5th term by 12.</span>",
            body: "<span class=\"ln\">t₃=a+2d=16</span><span class=\"ln\">t₇−t₅=2d=12 ⇒ d=6.</span><span class=\"ln\">a+12=16 ⇒ a=4.</span><span class=\"ln\">∴ AP = <span class=\"box\">4,10,16,22,…</span>.</span>",
