            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">★8</span><span class=\"qtext\">The sum of the 4th and 8th terms of an AP is 24 and the sum of the 6th and 10th terms is 44. Find the first three terms of the AP.</span>",
            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">Let first term=a and common difference=d.</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">t₄=a+3d, t₈=a+7d</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">t₄+t₈=24</span>\n<span class=\"ln arrow-step\">2a+10d=24 ...(1)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">t₆+t₁₀=44</span>\n<span class=\"ln arrow-step\">2a+14d=44 ...(2)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Subtracting (1) from (2):</span>\n<span class=\"ln arrow-step\">4d=20</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">d=<span class=\"box\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2a+50=24</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2a=−26</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">a=<span class=\"box\">−13</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln imp-step\">First three terms are <span class=\"box\">−13, −8, −3</span>.</span>\n",
            plainText: "★8. The sum of the 4th and 8th terms of an AP is 24 and the sum of the 6th and 10th terms is 44. Find the first three terms of the AP. Let first term=a and common difference=d. t₄=a+3d, t₈=a+7d t₄+t₈=24 2a+10d=24 ...(1) t₆+t₁₀=44 2a+14d=44 ...(2) Subtracting (1) from (2): 4d=20 d=5 2a+50=24 2a=−26 a=−13 First three terms are −13, −8, −3.",
