            head: "<span class=\"qnum\">★13</span><span class=\"qtext\">The sum of the first three terms of a geometric progression is 26, and the sum of their squares is 364. Find the terms of the GP.</span>",
            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">Let the GP be a, ar, ar².</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Given, a+ar+ar²=26 ...(1)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">a²+a²r²+a²r⁴=364</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">=a²(1+r²+r⁴)=364 ...(2)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Solving (1) and (2), we get the three terms</span>\n<span class=\"ln imp-step\"><span class=\"box\">2, 6, 18</span> (in one order).</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Check: 2+6+18=26 and 4+36+324=364.</span>\n",
