            body: "\n<span class=\"ln\">W₁=1, W₂=2</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">For n&gt;2, Wₙ=W₁+W₂+…+Wₙ₋₂+2.</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">W₃=W₁+2=1+2=<span class=\"box\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">W₄=W₁+W₂+2=1+2+2=<span class=\"box\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">W₅=W₁+W₂+W₃+2=1+2+3+2=<span class=\"box\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Similarly,</span>\n<span class=\"ln center\"><span class=\"box\">1,2,3,5,8,13,21,34</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\">Do you recognise this sequence?</span>\n<span class=\"ln imp-step\">It is the <span class=\"box\">Fibonacci sequence</span>.</span>\n",
            plainText: "★15. Suppose W₁ = 1, W₂ = 2 and for n > 2, Wₙ = W₁ + W₂ + … + Wₙ₋₂ + 2. Find the values of W₁, W₂, …, W₈. Do you recognise this sequence? W₁=1, W₂=2 For n>2, Wₙ=W₁+W₂+…+Wₙ₋₂+2. W₃=W₁+2=1+2=3 W₄=W₁+W₂+2=1+2+2=5 W₅=W₁+W₂+W₃+2=1+2+3+2=8 Similarly, 1,2,3,5,8,13,21,34 Do you recognise this sequence? It is the Fibonacci sequence.",
